  "html": "\n\n\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<section class=\"block\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"/ollie-tree-redesign/cn/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/2021/10/5A9527B8-2242-43A9-8919-53FE5F502319_ver001.jpg\" title=\"5A9527B8-2242-43A9-8919-53FE5F502319_ver001\" alt=\"msedge\n10/11/2021 , 3:30:49 PM\nCart - Sam's Club and 17 more pages - Personal - Microsoft? Edge\" loading=\"lazy\">\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t</section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"block\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<h1>2021年社区义诊10月金秋如约而至。</h1>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h6>义诊日期：<br>周六10/23 &nbsp; 周日10/24 &nbsp;周六10/30<br>上午：9点到中午12点<br>下午：1点到4点<br>*周日10/24上午时段没有诊所义诊<br>&nbsp;<br>义诊预约方式：&nbsp;<br>电话语音：732-993-1681<br>电话短信：732-593-9701<br>微信联络：OllieTree<br>电子邮件预约确认：<br><a href=\"mailto:OllieTreeFoundation@gmail.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">OllieTreeFoundation@gmail.com</a></h6>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"gallery\"><img src=\"/ollie-tree-redesign/cn/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/2021/10/1E3CC2CE-68AC-41D1-B2FB-8ECD0BC1BB65.jpg\" alt=\"1E3CC2CE-68AC-41D1-B2FB-8ECD0BC1BB65\"><img src=\"/ollie-tree-redesign/cn/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/2021/10/824F577A-7699-428A-87F5-9A084974A070.jpg\" alt=\"824F577A-7699-428A-87F5-9A084974A070\"><img src=\"/ollie-tree-redesign/cn/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/2021/10/IMG_1255.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_1255\"><img src=\"/ollie-tree-redesign/cn/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/2021/10/IMG_1253.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_1253\"><img src=\"/ollie-tree-redesign/cn/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/2021/10/IMG_1251.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_1251\"><img src=\"/ollie-tree-redesign/cn/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/2021/10/IMG_1259.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_1259\"><img src=\"/ollie-tree-redesign/cn/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/2021/10/IMG_1256.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_1256\"><img src=\"/ollie-tree-redesign/cn/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/2021/10/IMG_1257.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_1257\"></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t</section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"row cols-2\"><div class=\"col\">\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img width=\"500\" height=\"664\" src=\"/ollie-tree-redesign/cn/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/2020/09/author.png\" alt=\"\">\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t</div><div class=\"col\">\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<h4>The relay race of love, let's come together.</h4>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2>爱的接力赛，我们一起来。</h2>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div>橄榄树基金的同工和朋友：平安！</div><div>今年的华人社区义诊又快到了，线上线下约有40-<wbr>50人义工及医务人员已经准备就绪为社区有需要的同胞服务。<wbr>我们需要您将义诊的信息告诉身边的朋友或各种社交圈，<wbr>这也是教会弟兄姐妹与社区朋友建立关系、传播福音的开始。</div><div>您可以在教会、学校、<wbr>中国店及中餐馆转发或打印上面的义诊宣传单张，<wbr>而且不仅仅局限于夏洛特地区（线上）。</div><div>因为：“我实在告诉你们：<wbr>这些事你们既作在我这弟兄中一个最小的身上，就是作在我身上了。<wbr>”</div><div>神祝福各位</div>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<a target=\"_blank\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tFacebook-f\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<a target=\"_blank\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tTwitter\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<a target=\"_blank\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tYoutube\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t</div></section>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n"
